    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Yggdrasil Defenders </strong></i>is a solo roguelite game, based on Norse mythology, where you need to use your abilities and make choices to defend the realms of Yggdrasil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the Defenders, build your character with many skills, stats, passives and survive waves of monsters that try to invades the realms of Yggdrasil. By surviving or dying, you collect helcoins that can be used to buy permanent bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Characters and 9 Skills :</strong> Each character have a native <strong>skill</strong> with a strong <strong>passive</strong>, choose carefully !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lots of stats</strong>\u00a0: 20 different <strong>stats</strong> to improve to get stronger\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain levels and buy runes :</strong> By leveling or killing enemies, you will get <strong>tokens</strong> that can be used to buy beautiful <strong>runes</strong> and improve your <strong>stats</strong>. <strong>Stats</strong> increase with the quality of the <strong>rune</strong> !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wave :</strong>\u00a0By finishing one wave, you will be able to buy skill\u00a0<strong>scrolls</strong> or <strong>stats scrolls.</strong> Skill scrolls will level up your skills and stats scroll will give you multiple stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helcoins and market :</strong> By surviving or dying, you will get 1 helcoins per enemy killed, which can be useful to buy <strong>permanent bonuses in the market</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Yggdrasil Defenders </strong></i>is a solo roguelite game, based on Norse mythology, where you need to use your abilities and make choices to defend the realms of Yggdrasil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the Defenders, build your character with many skills, stats, passives and survive waves of monsters that try to invades the realms of Yggdrasil. By surviving or dying, you collect helcoins that can be used to buy permanent bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Characters and 9 Skills :</strong> Each character have a native <strong>skill</strong> with a strong <strong>passive</strong>, choose carefully !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lots of stats</strong>\u00a0: 20 different <strong>stats</strong> to improve to get stronger\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain levels and buy runes :</strong> By leveling or killing enemies, you will get <strong>tokens</strong> that can be used to buy beautiful <strong>runes</strong> and improve your <strong>stats</strong>. <strong>Stats</strong> increase with the quality of the <strong>rune</strong> !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wave :</strong>\u00a0By finishing one wave, you will be able to buy skill\u00a0<strong>scrolls</strong> or <strong>stats scrolls.</strong> Skill scrolls will level up your skills and stats scroll will give you multiple stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helcoins and market :</strong> By surviving or dying, you will get 1 helcoins per enemy killed, which can be useful to buy <strong>permanent bonuses in the market</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
